[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17760.03, "timestamp": "04:56:00", "text": "うーん、氷河"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17769.51, "timestamp": "04:56:09", "text": "魔法。おお。えっと、私はただこのことだけ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17770.67, "timestamp": "04:56:10", "text": "そして、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17772.51, "timestamp": "04:56:12", "text": "これ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17779.59, "timestamp": "04:56:19", "text": "実際は装備品とかそういうもののために。私たちは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17781.59, "timestamp": "04:56:21", "text": "たくさんの物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17791.868, "timestamp": "04:56:31", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17797.15, "timestamp": "04:56:37", "text": "それで、ウィンロはたくさんの新しい手紙を受け取り、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17811.43, "timestamp": "04:56:51", "text": "外？デプロイの時点を取り上げてみましょう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17813.75, "timestamp": "04:56:53", "text": "時間を節約するために飛行機に乗るのではなく、"}]